{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The proposed development comprising the conversion\r\nof industrial floor space to residential use by reason of its design, layout\r\nand inadequate provision of gross internal floor spaces would provide\r\nsubstandard living conditions for future occupiers. As such, the development is\r\ncontrary to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Policy\r\nDM 1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), Policy D6(A)(F)\r\nof The London Plan (2021), the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), the\r\nMayor of London Supplementary Planning Guidance Housing (2016), The London Plan\r\nGuidance and the Harrow Council’s adopted Supplementary Planning Document:\r\nResidential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposal would result in the loss of\r\nindustrial floor space. The applicant has failed to clearly demonstrate that it\r\nis not possible for the existing use to continue in this location as a viable option\r\nand no marketing evidence has been provided in support of the application. The\r\nproposal would thereby be contrary to Policy DM31 of the Harrow Development\r\nManagement Policies (2013), Policy E4 of the London Plan (2021), and the policy\r\nguidance set out in the National Planning Policy Framework.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
